                <li>Long-Distance Trains (Crescent, Silver Service, etc.) offer scenic alternatives with comfortable service.</li>
                <li>While slower than flying, all services offer comfortable seating, scenic views, and city-center arrivals, which can save time compared to driving during heavy traffic.</li>
