                <li><b>Recommended Arrival:</b> 20-30 minutes before departure.</li>
                <li><b>Facilities:</b> Ticket counters, waiting areas, restrooms, small cafés, and parking.</li>
                <li><b>Signage:</b> Platforms and departure boards are clearly marked for easy navigation.</li>
            </ul>
            <h3>Boarding Process</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Platforms are usually announced 15-20 minutes before departure.</li>
                <li>Boarding is straightforward, with clearly marked coach and business class cars.</li>
                <li>No airport-style security checks, making the process quick and simple.</li>
            </ul>
            <h3>Onboard Experience</h3>
            <p>The Baltimore → Newark train journey is designed for comfort and relaxation:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><b>Seating:</b> Spacious, adjustable, with good legroom.</li>
                <li><b>Amenities:</b> Overhead storage, power outlets, and free Wi‑Fi (where available).</li>
                <li><b>Environment:</b> Quiet, especially in Business Class and Acela.</li>
                <li><b>Scenery:</b> Enjoy views of the Chesapeake Bay, Delaware River, Philadelphia skyline, and the suburban landscapes of New Jersey.</li>
